#. Text of the outro. The lines must not be longer than 43 characters (the length of the longest English line).
#. German: LORDKANZLER KARWAIN:
#.   
#.   WIEDER EINMAL HABEN EIN PAAR WENIGE MIT MUT
#.   UND AUSDAUER BEWIESEN, DAß DIE KRAFT DES
#.   BÖSEN NICHT ALLMÄCHTIG IST.
#: outro/chancellor/00
msgctxt "outro/chancellor/00"
msgid ""
"LORD KARWAIN SAYS :\n"
"\n"
"A FEW BRAVE PEOPLE HAVE PROVEN THAT EVIL IS\n"
"NOT ALL-POWERFUL."
msgstr ""

#. Text of the outro. The lines must not be longer than 38 characters (the length of the longest English line).
#. German: LASST UNS ALLE HOFFEN, DAß TARBOS NUN FÜR
#.   IMMER GEBANNT IST, UND ALLE LEBEWESEN VON
#.   LYRAMION IN FRIEDEN LEBEN KÖNNEN.
#: outro/chancellor/01
msgctxt "outro/chancellor/01"
msgid ""
"LET US PRAY THAT TARBOS HAS NOW BEEN\n"
"BANISHED FOREVER, AND THAT ALL LIFE ON\n"
"LYRAMION MAY LIVE IN PEACE."
msgstr ""

#. Text of the outro. The lines must not be longer than 43 characters (the length of the longest English line).
#. German: DAS FEST SOLL BEGINNEN, TRINKT UND ESST
#.   SOVIEL IHR WOLLT. LASSET UNS AUF DEN BALKON
#.   GEHEN, UND UNSER GELIEBTES LYRAMION
#.   BETRACHTEN...
#: outro/chancellor/02
msgctxt "outro/chancellor/02"
msgid ""
"THE FESTIVITIES HAVE STARTED, EAT AND DRINK\n"
"TO YOUR HEART'S CONTENT.\n"
"LET US GO ON THE BALCONY, TO BEHOLD OUR\n"
"BELOVED LYRAMION..."
msgstr ""

#. Text of the outro. The lines must not be longer than 42 characters (the length of the longest English line).
#. German: FRIEDEN UND GLÜCK SIND IN LYRAMION
#.   EINGEKEHRT. SELBST DER DRACHE FLIEGT
#.   IN FREUNDSCHAFT MIT DEN ADLERN.
#: outro/balcony/00
msgctxt "outro/balcony/00"
msgid ""
"PEACE AND HAPPINESS HAVE RETURNED TO\n"
"LYRAMION ONCE MORE. EVEN THE MIGHTY DRAGON\n"
"FLIES IN HARMONY WITH THE GIANT EAGLE."
msgstr ""

#. Text of the outro. The lines must not be longer than 39 characters (the length of the longest English line).
#. German: DOCH WARUM PULSIERT DER DRITTE MOND VON
#.   LYRAMION IN EINEM DUNKLEN ROT ?
#.   HAT LORD TARBOS EINEN NEUEN WEG GEFUNDEN
#.   SICH ZU BEFREIEN ?
#: outro/balcony/01
msgctxt "outro/balcony/01"
msgid ""
"BUT WHY DOES LYRAMION'S THIRD MOON GLOW\n"
"EVILLY, WITH A BLOOD-RED LIGHT ?\n"
"HAS LORD TARBOS FOUND A NEW WAY TO FREE\n"
"HIMSELF ?"
msgstr ""

#. Text of the outro. The lines must not be longer than 43 characters (the length of the longest English line).
#. German: DIESE FRAGEN WIRD WOHL NUR AMBERMOON,
#.   DER ZWEITE TEIL DER BERNSTEIN-TRILOGIE,
#.   BEANTWORTEN...
#: outro/balcony/02
msgctxt "outro/balcony/02"
msgid ""
"THESE QUESTIONS AND MORE WILL BE ANSWERED\n"
"IN AMBERMOON, THE SECOND PART OF THE AMBER-\n"
"TRILOGY..."
msgstr ""

